He's prepared to die at any time!

7332
00:07:21,810 --> 00:07:24,650
He's put every fiber of being into his dream!

7333
00:07:24,650 --> 00:07:30,160
The strong mindset created from eliminating any
option of retreat is what pushes him forward!

7334
00:07:31,410 --> 00:07:36,080
This is all I had. That's why I
will lose everything if I lose.

7335
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:41,830
Everything I've built until now will crumble.

7336
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:44,500
For someone like me, who wasn't
born with demonic power,

7337
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:49,130
