7341
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:08,030
That's why...! That's the very reason why...

7342
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:10,610
...I want to defeat a man like you!

7343
00:08:15,990 --> 00:08:20,620
I have a dream, too. I want to make
President the King of this game!

7344
00:08:20,620 --> 00:08:22,750
Then, I will eventually become king myself!

7345
00:08:22,750 --> 00:08:29,960
And then, I will become the strongest Pawn ever!

7346
00:08:36,930 --> 00:08:39,270
