Lord Sairaorg has already lost consciousness.

7352
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,250
Huh?!

7353
00:09:07,250 --> 00:09:10,420
Even so, he was so happy.

7354
00:09:10,420 --> 00:09:14,300
He rushed forward, straight forward...

7355
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:18,560
He truly enjoyed the fight with you,
betting his dream on the line!

7356
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:25,230
He was fighting out of sheer will.

7357
00:09:25,230 --> 00:09:28,480
Even though he lost consciousness,
he still moved forward.

7358
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:32,360
Only forward, toward his dreams...

7359
00:09:35,110 --> 00:09:36,660
Thank you.

7360
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:40,240
Thank you very much!

7361
00:09:53,050 --> 00:09:56,510
Sairaorg Bael has resigned!

7362
