7479
00:16:55,510 --> 00:16:59,390
I waited. I waited so long.

7480
00:16:59,390 --> 00:17:03,310
But, I didn't have the courage to say anything.

7481
00:17:03,310 --> 00:17:05,310
But, back then...

7482
00:17:05,310 --> 00:17:09,730
When I heard your feelings... I was so happy.

7483
00:17:09,730 --> 00:17:13,860
I was going to go crazy
in the middle of a match.

7484
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:19,120
D-Does that mean... I can
take that as your answer?

7485
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:31,260
Issei. I love you. I love you
more than anyone else.

7486
00:17:40,430 --> 00:17:42,100
Ouch.

7487
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:43,850
