7488
00:17:43,850 --> 00:17:49,900
Um, congratulations! Now I can
follow in big sister's footsteps!

7489
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:53,690
Now I can go after Issei without holding back!

7490
00:17:53,690 --> 00:17:57,950
