8387
00:20:39,150 --> 00:20:41,280
How is Hyoudou Issei?

8388
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:44,370
Looks like he finally confessed to Rias.

8389
00:20:44,370 --> 00:20:48,040
I think that man fits Rias the best.

8390
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:50,700
The fact that you are worrying
about others at a time like this...

8391
00:20:50,700 --> 00:20:54,040
A good guy, through and through.

8392
00:20:55,460 --> 00:20:57,750
Starting from square one again, huh?

8393
00:20:57,750 --> 00:21:01,170
Not a problem. I'm used to it.

8394
00:21:01,170 --> 00:21:04,470
Our idiot was worrying about you.

8395
00:21:04,470 --> 00:21:08,600
Please tell him this. I'll catch up quickly.

8396
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,310
Lord Sairaorg!

8397
00:21:23,950 --> 00:21:25,530
Mother...

8398
00:21:27,530 --> 00:21:30,660
Mother! It's Sairaorg!

8399
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:32,580
Do you recognize me?

8400
00:21:32,580 --> 00:21:35,670
Yes, I do.

8401
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:41,710
My dear Sairaorg...

8402
00:21:41,710 --> 00:21:47,680
In my dreams, I felt like I watched you grow.

8403
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:49,890
You've become a fine man.

8404
00:21:49,890 --> 00:21:51,970
I still have a long way to go.

8405
00:21:55,310 --> 00:22:00,480
Mother, let us return to that home of ours.

8406
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:03,440
You were the one who created
this miracle, weren't you?

8407
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:05,320
The Booblingual...

8408
00:22:05,320 --> 00:22:08,450
There could be no other reason.

8409
00:22:08,450 --> 00:22:10,660
The miraculous Boob Dragon.

8410
00:22:10,660 --> 00:22:16,790
Oh, how that stupidity of yours
will envelope everyone...

8411
00:22:16,790 --> 00:22:20,170
I still want to see how far you'll go.

8412
00:22:22,250 --> 00:22:25,760
Lord Sakra, there is something
I wish to ask you.

8413
00:22:25,760 --> 00:22:28,840
Hey, the fallen angel of justice!

8414
00:22:28,840 --> 00:22:32,680
You knew about Cao Cao
before we did, did you not?

8415
00:22:34,270 --> 00:22:40,270
I've known him since he was a little brat.
What's the problem?

8416
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:41,520
Indra!

8417
00:22:42,690 --> 00:22:48,030
Calling me by that name.
That's pretty saucy of you, 'lil Azazel!

8418
00:22:49,660 --> 00:22:57,290
It's the true nature of a God to spout ideals
while planning who knows what in the darkness.

8419
00:22:57,290 --> 00:23:00,380
I know that! However...

8420
00:23:00,380 --> 00:23:03,130
Well, I'll help you on the surface.

8421
00:23:03,130 --> 00:23:06,590
It's true that Orphis is a problem.

8422
00:23:06,590 --> 00:23:11,850
Oh, tell that Tit Dragon that he was the best.

8423
00:23:11,850 --> 00:23:18,390
Also, if he becomes a danger to the world,
I will destroy his very soul.

8424
00:23:18,390 --> 00:23:22,690
"Heaven" should be only be a label for us!

